# Signing keys — private key material must never be committed. The ceremony
# script writes it to packaging/shedos-keyring/shedos-private.asc; this guard
# is defense-in-depth in case someone forgets to shred before `git add`.
packaging/shedos-keyring/shedos-private.asc
*-private.asc
